NetControl (Rust rebuild)

This project is a Rust reimplementation of NetControl, a C# / .NET 8 / Avalonia
application by Abel Meza Enriquez (nov0caina), published under the MIT License
at https://github.com/nov0caina/NetControl. The original copyright notice is
retained in LICENSE. Behavior, constants, protocol layouts, the OUI vendor
table, the color palette, and the application icon (assets/app_icon.ico,
assets/app_icon.png) are derived from that project.

This rebuild is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original author.

Third-party components (Rust crates; see Cargo.lock for exact versions):
  eframe / egui / egui_extras  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  pnet                         MIT OR Apache-2.0
  if-addrs                     MIT OR BSD-3-Clause
  mac_address                  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  windows-sys                  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  libc                         MIT OR Apache-2.0
  ...and their transitive dependencies, under their respective licenses.

Runtime dependency (not redistributed): Npcap (https://npcap.com/) is required
for Live capture on Windows. Npcap is licensed separately by Insecure.Com LLC
and must be installed by the user; it is not bundled with NetControl.
